// boring's own Haxe build and test project (feature spec 59).
//
// Every bundle takes its module roots from a named source set below and the
// remaining generation arguments from its own haxeArgs; the hand-written
// roots hxml files that used to supply both are gone (task
// refactor/project-file-single-entry). Arguments the driver already derives
// - <target>-output, <target>-test-output, <target>-test-runner,
// float-precision and the sourceRoots classpaths - are deliberately not
// repeated here.
//
// Target-only roots are declared below. The bundle driver
// (packages/driver/src/driver/Compare.hx) and the roots guard read the same
// declarations from this project file, so a declaration can never be a free
// pass: the guard verifies it against the roots above and the test modules
// under the guarded classpaths.
// @only-in: precision:binary64 registry.Main
// @only-in: target:rust tests.EscapingTraitIdentityTests
// @dormant: rust tests.E0308FiTests
// @only-in: precision:f32 tests.f32.PrintedFloatTests
